    "Prices are per 1,000,000 tokens in the model's own currency.",
    "Each model has either flat 'rates', or a 'peak' / 'idle' pair plus a 'peak_window' key.",
    "fx maps a currency to how many units 1 USD buys; costs are stored in USD.",
    "DeepSeek peak: Beijing time, Mon-Fri 09:00-12:00 and 14:00-18:00, excluding Chinese statutory holidays; every other hour is idle and costs half.",
    "Statutory holidays are listed explicitly — add next year's State Council dates, otherwise holidays get priced as peak.",
